	(text "Wireless Miniscope v0.2 motherboard\n\nInterfaces:\n* Battery 2 pin connector\n	* Half-pitch (1.27 mm) pin socket\n* 16 pin board-to-board connector\n	* +1V8 bus\n	* +3V3 bus\n	* GND (3 pin)\n	* Wireless power Vin (2 pin), ADC (1 pin)\n	* SPI-based data transmitter (2 pin)\n	* UART (2 pin)\n	* SWD (3 pin)\n	* Excitation LED port\n* Push button (for power on)\n* Indicators: power-on LED, status LED\n* IR receiver\n\nSupported operations:\n* Hot start: Push switch -> battery operation -> wireless powered operation\n* Cold start: directly enter wireless power operation (stability issue in v0.1)\n\nMotherboard capabilities:\n* Battery voltage monitoring: ADC\n* Wireless power voltage monitoring: ADC (from daugherboard)\n* Downlink wireless communication: IR Receiver\n* Uplink wireless communication: SPI output (to daughterboard)\n* Excitation LED driver (LED on daughterboard)\n* Wired communication: UART (on daugherboard)\n\nMiniscope Daughterboard:\n* Wireless power receiver (coil interface + rectifier + pre-regulator)\n* Optical data transmitter\n* Excitation LED\n\nDebug/development/baseplating Daughterboard:\n* Wireless power receiver (coil interface + rectifier + pre-regulator + ADC)\n* Optical data transmitter\n* Excitation LED\n* UART port\n* SWD port\n* SPI port\n\nKiCad libraries (to do: organize)\n* https://github.com/t-sasatani/TS-KiCad\n* https://github.com/t-sasatani/KiCad-Library (fork of Aharoni-Lab/KiCad-Library)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.605 402.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f1e145d8-643a-431a-906e-75892422829b")
	)
